(text "J8: hand-solder recessed female 2x5 2.54 mm socket; CUSTOM electrical pinout.\nPin 6 is 3.3 V reference OUTPUT, never a programming power input.\nPB0/PB1 read sensor-rail ADCs; PA15 enables 5 V and PB7 high enables 12 V.\nPA3/PA4 monitor active-low fault flags. PB5/PB6/PB4 are input pull-down controls." (at 20 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b70394c-1ae4-53fc-84b6-1357b55622ef"))
